tps://api.github.com/users/Kimau/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T13:58:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T13:58:28Z","body":"Confirmed on android XR builds. Good to know ^_^","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2528034829/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529706268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100097#issuecomment-2529706268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100097","id":2529706268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WyEEc","user":{"login":"cixil","id":22418985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDE4OTg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22418985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil","html_url":"https://github.com/cixil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cixil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T22:52:08Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T23:06:32Z","body":"Can anyone explain exactly what the role is for this flag:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/aa8d9b83f66488dbb2c9c918e9016ef80f821fb4/core/object/object.h#L575\n\nand these enums?:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/aa8d9b83f66488dbb2c9c918e9016ef80f821fb4/scene/resources/packed_scene.h#L126-L131\n\nre @KoBeWi's comment\nI don't quite understand why the inherited flag would be *added*  during instantiation, isn't this flag just supposed to be a way for the editor to determine which connections are a part of the scene?\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/aa8d9b83f66488dbb2c9c918e9016ef80f821fb4/scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp#L609\n\nEDIT: Ah I see this is added when instantiated scenes are added as children in the editor? I forget the same code is used in the game runtime and in the editor","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529706268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529708995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100097#issuecomment-2529708995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100097","id":2529708995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WyEvD","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/event