pi.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100097","id":2564559793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Y3BOx","user":{"login":"daveTheOldCoder","id":55119684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MTE5Njg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55119684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder","html_url":"https://github.com/daveTheOldCoder","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/daveTheOldCoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-28T23:51:01Z","updated_at":"2024-12-28T23:56:57Z","body":"You can also download the version-specific pre-built export templates outside of Godot. For example, you can download the 4.4-dev7 export templates here: https://godotengine.org/download/archive/4.4-dev7/\n\nThe download feature in the export panel hasn't been working for me in the 4.4-dev's, so I've had to get the export templates in that manner, and then use the export panel's \"Install from File\" button.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2564559793/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2646631701","html_url